ollowing_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"There are two severe problems here:\n- The single-view mode having a background breaks visual consistency with the rest of the docks.\n- The horizontal split-view mode backgrounds have no margins, so they just hug the borders.","state":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119450#pullrequestreview-4287555375","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119450","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119450#pullrequestreview-4287555375"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119450"}},"submitted_at":"2026-05-14T05:37:46Z","commit_id":"7716f46c05f8be97ce1065493d16400a40abc44b"},{"id":4303746561,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAIX2AQ","user":{"login":"passivestar","id":60579014,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwNTc5MDE0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60579014?u=ec87bf81cd2f5f0947670400f48cf0845c25d719&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar","html_url":"https://github.com/passivestar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This shifts it from \"in 1 of 3 modes the background appears\" to \"in 2 of 3 modes the background appears\", if @AdriaandeJongh is satisfied with it I'm fine with it, since it's his original linked issue. I think it's fine if the goal is to get the same look for both split modes.\r\n\r\nIf I could I'd make a rulebook for when there needs to be a background and when not, but I looked at a lot of different apps when we were porting the theme to see how others handle it, and it's all case by case depending on where it makes sense, with most leaning towards no backgrounds unless there's a big benefit from them. One thing I'm sure of is that you don't want to go for full consistency here because the previous theme consistently had backgrounds in every tree and every item list and it made the UI look busier than it should have been in the main editor layout.","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119450#pullrequestreview-4303746561","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119450","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119450#pullrequestreview-4303746561"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119450"}},"submitted_at":"2026-05-16T14:18:42Z","commit_id":"78c3219b85c79e13025284f71ad8c11cc591e500"},{"id":4303748025,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAIX7uQ","user":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_